---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import site from "../data/site.json";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" noindex>
  <article class="legal">
    <span class="eyebrow">Legal · Draft for review</span><h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="legal-notice">This pre-launch draft must still be reviewed and completed with the final hosting providers and data processors before public launch.</p>
    <h2>Information collected</h2><p>Wayne Omni may collect information you choose to provide through enquiry forms, project briefs or direct communication, together with limited technical data needed to operate and understand the website.</p>
    <h2>How information may be used</h2><p>Information may be used to respond to enquiries, evaluate project fit, provide requested services, improve the website, maintain security and meet legal obligations.</p>
    <h2>Project brief form</h2><p>When you send the project brief on the contact page, your name, email, company, website and message are stored securely in a Cloudflare D1 database, together with the page you sent it from, an approximate country and a one-way hashed version of your IP address used only to prevent spam. Cloudflare Turnstile may check that the submission comes from a person.</p><p>Your brief is emailed to Wayne, and a one-off copy is emailed to the address you entered, using the email provider Resend. An AI model (Cloudflare Workers AI) reads the brief to prepare an internal summary and a draft reply for Wayne. Wayne reviews every reply personally; no decision about you is made automatically and nothing AI-written is sent to you without his review. Form submissions are kept for up to 24 months unless you ask for them to be deleted sooner.</p>
    <h2>Analytics</h2><p>The website uses Google Analytics 4 to understand how visitors use the site, for example which pages are viewed and when a form is submitted. Form contents and contact details are not sent to Google Analytics.</p>
    <h2>Sharing and retention</h2><p>Personal information should only be shared with service providers required to operate the business or when legally required. It should be retained only as long as needed for the stated purpose.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2><p>You may request access, correction or deletion of personal data where applicable by emailing <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
